<title>USA: MasTec says FMR Corp ownes 10.1 pct.</title>
<headline>MasTec says FMR Corp ownes 10.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>MasTec Inc said on Wednesday that it received notice that FMR Corp, the parent of Fidelity Management and Research, had acquired beneficial ownership of 1,693,500 common shares in the company.</p>
<p>This represents about 10.1 percent of the shares currently outstanding, MasTec said.</p>
